# NOTE — this file cannot exclude anything `package.json`'s `files` field
# whitelists. `files` wins; `.npmignore` only prunes inside what is already
# unlisted. That is why `modes/*/harness/` is excluded by a NEGATION IN
# `files` (`"!modes/*/harness/"`) and not from here — the first attempt put
# it here, and the packed tarball did not shrink by a single byte.
#
# What ships to npm is what a USER runs, not what a developer measured.

# Design documents and proposals — `docs/README.md` indexes them for
# contributors; a user gets README.md.
docs/

# Development toolchain: rules, subagents, workflows, commands. Read by
# agents working ON this repo, never by anyone running it.
.claude/
